{"key": "contrast:color-contrast:cf41bd98ee62", "issueId": null, "source": "scanner", "outcome": "rerate", "severityBefore": "medium", "severityAfter": "high", "reason": "The Save New Role button on create-role and the Share via email button on share-statement are dimmed with the appearDisabled style, and each label measures 1.25:1 (#d6dafa on #bac2f7) where AA needs 4.5:1. Neither is disabled: the tree exposes both as enabled buttons, and clicking Save New Role runs validation (shot:a11y/runs/2026-10-03-1525/shots/verify/verify-317/settings.create-role-errors-top.png), so the inactive-component exception does not apply. It is the primary action on both screens and far under 2:1, so it goes to high.", "reasonCode": null, "counterEvidence": null, "probes": [{"build": "0c71cd6c04c156c7db9581351966063c95f0a701", "env": {"colorScheme": "light", "dpr": 1, "reducedMotion": "reduce", "viewport": [1440, 900]}, "id": "probe-cdcff671ed78", "kind": "contrast", "pass": false, "state": "settings.create-role", "value": {"bg": "#bac2f7", "fg": "#d6dafa", "fontSize": "11.3pt (15px)", "fontWeight": "normal", "incomplete": false, "messageKey": null, "ratio": 1.25, "required": 4.5}, "xpath": "/html/body/div[1]/main[1]/div[1]/div[2]/div[2]/div[3]/form[1]/div[1]/div[1]/div[1]/button[1]/div[1]"}, {"build": "0c71cd6c04c156c7db9581351966063c95f0a701", "env": {"colorScheme": "light", "dpr": 1, "reducedMotion": "reduce", "viewport": [1440, 900]}, "id": "probe-433bf2762b3c", "kind": "ax", "pass": null, "state": "settings.create-role", "value": {"description": "", "ignored": false, "name": "Save New Role", "role": "button", "states": {}, "template": "button \"Save New Role\""}, "xpath": "/html/body/div[1]/main[1]/div[1]/div[2]/div[2]/div[3]/form[1]/div[1]/div[1]/div[1]/button[1]"}, {"build": "0c71cd6c04c156c7db9581351966063c95f0a701", "env": {"colorScheme": "light", "dpr": 1, "reducedMotion": "reduce", "viewport": [1440, 900]}, "id": "probe-451cc817f55a", "kind": "contrast", "pass": false, "st