{"key": "focus-visible:focus-not-visible:4356395e6097", "issueId": null, "source": "scanner", "outcome": "confirm", "severityBefore": "medium", "severityAfter": "medium", "reason": "Tab to the Spend combobox on create-role and to the Control type combobox on invite-issue-card changes no pixels, because the fixed footer covers both fields (shot:a11y/runs/2026-10-03-1525/shots/verify/verify-317/settings.create-role-tab-stop-22-spend-combobox.png) and the page does not scroll. Keyboard users cannot see where focus is on a real form control. Arrow Down still opens the Control type list, so the task is possible but hard, and it stays medium.", "reasonCode": null, "counterEvidence": null, "probes": [{"build": "0c71cd6c04c156c7db9581351966063c95f0a701", "env": {"colorScheme": "light", "dpr": 1, "reducedMotion": "reduce", "viewport": [1440, 900]}, "id": "probe-6a1f1bba2965", "kind": "focus", "pass": false, "state": "settings.create-role", "value": {"diff": 0, "end": "body", "floor": 16, "hidden": null, "loop": null, "probes": [], "trapped": false, "via": "tab", "visible": false}, "xpath": "/html/body/div[1]/main[1]/div[1]/div[2]/div[2]/div[3]/form[1]/section[1]/div[3]/section[2]/div[3]/div[2]/div[1]/div[1]/input[1]"}, {"build": "0c71cd6c04c156c7db9581351966063c95f0a701", "env": {"colorScheme": "light", "dpr": 1, "reducedMotion": "reduce", "viewport": [1440, 900]}, "id": "probe-26a87d51a953", "kind": "focus", "pass": false, "state": "settings.invite-issue-card", "value": {"diff": 0, "end": "body", "floor": 16, "hidden": null, "loop": null, "probes": [], "trapped": false, "via": "tab", "visible": false}, "xpath": "/html/body/div[1]/main[1]/div[1]/div[2]/div[2]/div[3]/form[1]/section[1]/div[2]/div[1]/div[4]/div[2]/div[1]/div[1]/div[1]/div[1]/input[1]"}], "states": ["settings.create-role", "settings.invite-issue-card"], "build": "0c71cd6c04c156c7db9581351966063c95f0a701", "model": "sonnet", "batch": "verify-317", "prompt": "verifier@3", "attempt": 1, "second": false, "date": "2