{"key": "role-state:autocomplete-valid:dcca89570804", "issueId": null, "source": "scanner", "outcome": "drop", "severityBefore": "medium", "severityAfter": "medium", "reason": "The Spend combobox has autocomplete=\"garbage\", a deliberate autofill suppressor, on both sampled states. It picks a spend permission level (name expensePermissions), which is not information about the user and has no input purpose in WCAG's list, so 1.3.5 does not apply.", "reasonCode": "not-aa-failure", "counterEvidence": "probe-0c47462efcd0", "probes": [{"build": "0c71cd6c04c156c7db9581351966063c95f0a701", "env": {"colorScheme": "light", "dpr": 1, "reducedMotion": "reduce", "viewport": [1440, 900]}, "id": "probe-0c47462efcd0", "kind": "ax", "pass": null, "state": "settings.create-role", "value": {"description": "", "ignored": false, "name": "Spend", "role": "combobox", "states": {"expanded": false, "haspopup": "listbox"}, "template": "combobox \"Spend\" [expanded=false, haspopup=listbox]"}, "xpath": "/html/body/div[1]/main[1]/div[1]/div[2]/div[2]/div[3]/form[1]/section[1]/div[3]/section[2]/div[3]/div[2]/div[1]/div[1]/input[1]"}, {"build": "0c71cd6c04c156c7db9581351966063c95f0a701", "env": {"colorScheme": "light", "dpr": 1, "reducedMotion": "reduce", "viewport": [1440, 900]}, "id": "probe-e4fdcbbd18b7", "kind": "ax", "pass": null, "state": "settings.create-role-errors", "value": {"description": "", "ignored": false, "name": "Spend", "role": "combobox", "states": {"expanded": false, "haspopup": "listbox"}, "template": "combobox \"Spend\" [expanded=false, haspopup=listbox]"}, "xpath": "/html/body/div[1]/main[1]/div[1]/div[2]/div[2]/div[3]/form[1]/section[1]/div[3]/section[2]/div[3]/div[2]/div[1]/div[1]/input[1]"}], "states": ["settings.create-role", "settings.create-role-errors"], "build": "0c71cd6c04c156c7db9581351966063c95f0a701", "model": "sonnet", "batch": "verify-317", "prompt": "verifier@3", "attempt": 1, "second": false, "date": "2026-10-03", "criterionAnalysis": "1.3.5 Identify Input Purpose covers only fields that collect information about the user and serve one of the 53 listed purposes (name, email, address and so on). This field selects a permission level for a role, so no token applies and nothing is missing. 4.1.2 is met: the combobox exposes name Spend, role combobox, and expanded and haspopup states. No other A or AA criterion covers an invalid autocomplete token."}
